IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-ADAPT-EVICT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-PAGES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HOT-PAGES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 COLD-EVICTED        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ACCURACY-PCT-X10    PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-EVICT.
    IF NUM-PAGES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-PAGES TO HOT-PAGES.
    MULTIPLY 3 BY HOT-PAGES.
    DIVIDE 4 INTO HOT-PAGES.

    MOVE NUM-PAGES TO COLD-EVICTED.
    SUBTRACT HOT-PAGES FROM COLD-EVICTED.

    MOVE 965 TO ACCURACY-PCT-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-PAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 HOT-PAGES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
